72 760 Td
(Repotting) Tj T*
(Repot in spring when roots grow out of the drainage hole. Choose a pot) Tj T*
(only two to four centimetres wider than the old one and use fresh soil.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Pests) Tj T*
(Fungus gnats live in soil that stays wet; let the top layer dry out and) Tj T*
(use yellow sticky traps. Spider mites show up as fine webbing under the) Tj T*
(leaves; shower the plant and wipe the leaves weekly until they are gone.) Tj T*
ET
